default has to be spelled out to keep the old behaviour.

Nested None (e.g. Dict[Union[str, None], ...] or List[Optional[str]]) does not
count: pydantic v1 kept such fields required.

Reads the pristine file content from git HEAD, so it is idempotent.
"""
